WEBVTT

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:18.960
Who's calling my name?

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:22.560
I can hear the voice
of one who needs me.

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:26.860
Where...

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:31.460
Where are you?

00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:41.830
I am afraid to say but
she's in worse condition tonight.

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:55.130
I'm sorry to see
her suffer so much.

00:00:56.860 --> 00:00:59.200
I can ease her pain right away.

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:02.000
Who are you, stay back!

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:03.160
Hold your fire!

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:04.960
But sir...

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:07.200
I said hold it! Didn't you hear me?

00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:19.660
You... can you
save the princess?

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:21.260
Yes, sir.

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:31.000
Please... save her!

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:32.130
Save the princess!

00:01:49.130 --> 00:01:53.130
I want to see you but I can't
see you because it hurts so much.

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:57.230
I'm sure I must
be missing something...

00:01:57.230 --> 00:02:00.530
...and that's why my
prayer hasn't been answered.

00:02:00.530 --> 00:02:04.630
(Yami, the Hat and the Book traveler)
...and that's why my
prayer hasn't been answered.

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:11.560
I had always believed
that what I saw before me...

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:18.360
...was the only truth there was.

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:26.200
But now I know
there isn't just one world.

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:35.660
There are a thousand worlds called
"if" and I don't know which way to turn.

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:41.560
I want to see you but
I can't see you; where are you now?

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:44.700
I'll find you no matter the cost.

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:52.460
I've wandered into the
labyrinth of your eyes.

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:56.400
Even if the darkness bars my path...

00:02:56.400 --> 00:03:02.460
...even if my weak heart
is led astray, I won't give up.

00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:07.430
I'll keep searching for you.

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:24.430
Mariel

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:30.160
Princess Mariel, you
shouldn't laugh here...

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:33.030
Because?

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:39.760
Frogs are the
guardian angels of this country.

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:43.360
We were saved
because they prevented...

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:47.530
...the floods by
gathering and forming a wall.

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:50.300
That's just an old legend.

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:52.530
You're right, Princess Mariel.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:56.530
But, it's possible
that it was really people...

00:03:56.530 --> 00:04:00.300
...not frogs who piled up
the stones and prevented the flood.

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:03.100
You are saying it as if you were there.

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:09.100
But... that sounds more believable.

00:04:10.230 --> 00:04:15.730
If this legend is to
celebrate people's loyalty,...

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:21.760
...as a princess, you
should never forget them.

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:25.460
You're preaching to me, Ritsuko.

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:29.400
Well, well, my
princess is grumpy today.

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:35.530
Father, if you are going horse
back riding, please take me with you.

00:04:35.930 --> 00:04:38.600
You shouldn't or you
might get a fever again.

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:41.560
Ritsuko can cure me again.

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:43.860
So, please father...

00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:47.960
I'm so glad to hear you
can come with me for a ride.

00:04:48.730 --> 00:04:51.630
But you will turn 16 soon.

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:55.100
And you should stop being
a tomboy and find a fiance...

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:57.000
...so I can have peace of mind.

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:01.660
Is her birthday gala
ball being prepared?

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:04.530
Yes sir, things are
progressing very smoothly.

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:07.830
This year, you must choose
your fiance from one of the princes...

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:09.730
...of the nearby kingdoms.

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:11.260
Father!

00:05:11.260 --> 00:05:16.500
Ritsuko, Mariel is such a tomboy
but to me, she's the apple of my eye.

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:22.300
Still, that doesn't change the fact
that she is my only precious daughter.

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:26.230
Fortunately, she worships
you like an older sister.

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:28.700
Please continue to
take good care of her.

00:05:29.630 --> 00:05:31.430
I am highly honored.

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:36.200
My father is so mean.

00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:39.900
That's because he
loves you so much.

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:45.030
Please remember how
worried he was when you were sick.

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:50.260
So for his sake, please find an
eligible fiance soon, Princess Mariel.

00:05:51.930 --> 00:05:54.160
I am tired of hearing that story.

00:05:54.930 --> 00:05:57.100
Ritsuko, let's go for a walk.

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:03.830
Do you really
dislike the ball so much?

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:06.400
Or is it the engagement
that worries you?

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:09.360
My heart won't be
won no matter how many...

00:06:09.360 --> 00:06:11.630
...princes disguised as frogs show up.

00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:16.300
Even if frogs are
our guardian symbol,...

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:20.730
...why do I have to choose
someone in a green costume?

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:22.560
Frog costumes?

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:26.430
That's our kingdom's tradition.

00:06:26.930 --> 00:06:31.000
They wear frog
costumes and hop around.

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:35.030
I am told it helps
choose the right person but...

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:47.260
I only wish I could pick
someone I can actually love.

00:06:49.460 --> 00:06:52.330
Why doesn't my
father understand that?

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:55.600
No, he understands.

00:06:56.200 --> 00:06:57.160
You think so?

00:06:57.400 --> 00:07:01.130
Yes, he just doesn't
want to admit that you...

00:07:01.130 --> 00:07:05.100
...are old enough to be engaged.

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:07.800
I'm sure of it.

00:07:09.630 --> 00:07:12.560
I am already mature enough.

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:14.560
Say, Ritsuko.

00:07:15.430 --> 00:07:18.360
Have you ever
fallen in love, Ritsuko?

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:22.760
To be honest, I'm not sure.

00:07:27.230 --> 00:07:32.830
For the past 100 years, I've
been thinking of just one young boy.

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:37.630
But he must have
been long gone by now.

00:07:38.030 --> 00:07:43.930
It's a miracle I am still alive, Jill.

00:07:51.230 --> 00:07:53.400
Princess Mariel, you shouldn't...

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:54.400
Come on, hurry up!

00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:56.300
Let's go back, princess.

00:07:56.300 --> 00:07:58.200
Your father will be worried.

00:07:58.460 --> 00:08:00.630
If we go back now, it should be fine.

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:05.060
Besides, once I'm engaged, I won't be
allowed to leave the castle anymore.

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:10.260
So, please let me
enjoy my little adventure.

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:21.760
Why you! You want to
pick a fight with me?

00:08:29.560 --> 00:08:30.230
This way.

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:37.900
Whoever you are,
thank you for saving us.

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:45.100
Gargantua?

00:08:45.930 --> 00:08:46.960
It can't be!

00:09:06.930 --> 00:09:11.200
He looked just like
Gargantua, only older...

00:09:12.300 --> 00:09:15.700
...but it's been more
than 100 years since then.

00:09:17.730 --> 00:09:19.560
It couldn't be him.

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:25.330
Princess Mariel, your
highness has summoned you both.

00:09:33.060 --> 00:09:38.060
Let me introduce you to a very
famous alchemist, Mr. Gargantua.

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:41.230
Gargantua!?

00:09:41.630 --> 00:09:43.600
Oh, you know him?

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:45.330
Since you share
the same profession,...

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:47.500
...it's only natural
you might have met before.

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:50.800
No, this is the first time we've met.

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:55.200
My pleasure to be acquainted.

00:10:02.530 --> 00:10:03.500
Excuse me...

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:07.960
Excuse me, but are you...

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:11.760
Mr. Gargantua?

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:18.460
I'd like to talk you
some more, if that's okay?

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:23.360
I cannot refuse the request
of such a charming princess.

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:55.500
Oh my, Princess Mariel is
really fond of Mr. Gargantua.

00:10:58.000 --> 00:10:58.760
Wait!

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:04.760
Please tell me, are you... are you...

00:11:06.730 --> 00:11:09.530
You haven't changed, Ritsuko.

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:16.000
You have lived for a 100 years but
you still can't say what's on your mind.

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:19.830
Then, it really is you?

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:21.500
Yes.

00:11:22.460 --> 00:11:28.130
Then it's true, we were both
granted immortal life, thanks to Jill.

00:11:29.030 --> 00:11:30.700
Jill, who is that?

00:11:31.130 --> 00:11:33.500
How could you forget Jill?

00:11:37.030 --> 00:11:41.060
Are you serious? So you
don't remember what happened?

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:43.900
What you did to Jill...

00:11:48.800 --> 00:11:49.700
Gargantua?

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:51.400
Mr. Gargantua!

00:11:53.130 --> 00:11:54.500
Please stay with me!

00:11:55.800 --> 00:11:58.500
Ritsuko, what did
you do to Mr. Gargantua?

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:01.400
I just...

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:03.960
I don't what to hear your excuses!

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:07.260
Mr. Gargantua, this way, please.

00:12:11.530 --> 00:12:13.760
Stay with me, Mr. Gargantua.

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:16.260
Thank you, princess.

00:12:33.930 --> 00:12:36.300
I am alright now.

00:12:36.700 --> 00:12:38.830
No, I want you to stay with me.

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:41.200
Mr. Gargantua.

00:12:43.260 --> 00:12:46.700
Mr. Gargantua, I am... I am...

00:12:48.100 --> 00:12:51.260
I love you, Mr. Gargantua.

00:12:55.130 --> 00:13:01.260
I'm prepared to offer
myself to you, Mr. Gargantua!

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:26.130
What are we going to do in here?

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:28.730
A ceremony.

00:13:29.560 --> 00:13:34.000
It's important so
you can become mine.

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:42.260
But if you've
changed your mind...

00:13:42.260 --> 00:13:43.000
No!

00:13:43.700 --> 00:13:46.200
My feelings are the
same as I swore to you.

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:51.130
As you wish, Mr. Gargantua.

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:56.600
Then I take your word for it.

00:14:07.430 --> 00:14:11.730
(magic spell)

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:29.060
Beautiful! I shall seal
your beauty for all eternity!

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:41.630
Exactly as I expected.

00:14:53.460 --> 00:14:54.430
That must be-

00:15:05.560 --> 00:15:07.360
Gargantua, it's you!

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:13.500
This is the wedding ceremony
of Princess Mariel and myself.

00:15:14.030 --> 00:15:15.060
What did you just say?

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:20.830
It's wonderful, she
is so pure and innocent.

00:15:21.830 --> 00:15:25.860
Hence, she has no
resistance to evil.

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:37.900
You made her like that and
now you're trying to save her?

00:15:41.260 --> 00:15:43.530
You must have given her
some of your magical power...

00:15:44.230 --> 00:15:47.460
...so she
is susceptible to evil spirits?

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:52.800
I must thank you, Ritsuko.

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:56.200
You've made it easier for
me to accomplish my plan.

00:15:56.460 --> 00:15:57.360
Your plan!?

00:15:58.360 --> 00:15:59.230
Yes.

00:15:59.630 --> 00:16:07.160
I will conjure a most powerful force
by using Princess Mariel as my sacrifice.

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:10.260
It's boring when they die.

00:16:11.760 --> 00:16:12.600
No!

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:14.960
I won't let you do that!

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:50.960
This is the best that
you can do? How pathetic.

00:17:01.630 --> 00:17:03.900
I won't take your life.

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:10.960
Stay there and be a
witness to our wedding ceremony.

00:17:12.560 --> 00:17:13.760
Stop it!

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:15.700
Gargantua, stop it!

00:17:21.460 --> 00:17:22.530
Stop it!

00:17:27.660 --> 00:17:29.960
Nooo!

00:17:32.830 --> 00:17:34.130
It's too late.

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:37.060
No, I won't let you do this!

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:39.530
Jill, please help me.

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:41.000
Jill?

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:45.560
Jill, give me
more of your power!

00:17:45.560 --> 00:17:46.360
Stop it!

00:17:46.560 --> 00:17:48.100
Don't say that name!

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:52.900
With the power of the golden angel
of the north and south and silver...

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:57.230
...angel of the east and west.
I call upon you to empower me!

00:17:57.530 --> 00:18:01.530
Return now, Wanderer... by the power
of the archangel I have summoned.

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:05.000
Stop!... stop it now!

00:18:05.700 --> 00:18:09.430
(magic spell)

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:16.430
Stop it!

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:32.030
Quickly!

00:18:48.200 --> 00:18:50.200
You poor thing.

00:18:54.160 --> 00:18:56.330
Please, no!

00:18:58.330 --> 00:18:59.860
What happened, Ritsuko?

00:19:00.960 --> 00:19:01.960
Ritsuko!

00:19:02.360 --> 00:19:04.760
I take full responsibility.

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:12.930
When the princess awakens,
I will accept any punishment.

00:19:12.930 --> 00:19:14.830
But please spare me till then!

00:19:15.330 --> 00:19:20.160
I will save her life, no matter
what, even if it costs me my own.

00:19:33.760 --> 00:19:34.900
Princess Mariel!

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:37.300
Everything is fine now.

00:19:39.430 --> 00:19:40.660
The nightmare is over.

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:44.230
Nightmare is over?

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:54.530
If your smile and this
country remain safe, then...

00:19:56.330 --> 00:20:00.360
I harbor no regrets, even if I
have to die behind these bars.

00:20:03.730 --> 00:20:08.030
Father, please forgive me
for exiting this life before you.

00:20:08.730 --> 00:20:11.760
I can no longer live in this world.

00:20:12.730 --> 00:20:17.960
Half of my body has been
taken by evil spirits already.

00:20:19.200 --> 00:20:26.260
Before my spirit is even touched by
evil, I would rather take my own life.

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:33.630
Father, I love you
always and forever will.

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:40.260
Ritsuko is not at fault...
so please don't blame her.

00:20:41.530 --> 00:20:43.030
That is my last wish.

00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:45.630
Please honor it.

00:20:55.760 --> 00:20:58.500
No, it can't be true.

00:20:59.600 --> 00:21:03.900
Her body was found by
the pond early this morning

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:30.460
I have accepted the
spirit as the sacrifice.

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:53.300
I will offer up an eternal prayer.

00:21:53.560 --> 00:21:59.730
I will never give up on what matters.

00:22:02.560 --> 00:22:07.200
I will go there, praying.

00:22:07.760 --> 00:22:14.030
No matter the distance
between us, I will catch you.

00:22:14.300 --> 00:22:21.860
That's a promise between you and I.

00:22:22.060 --> 00:22:29.200
Crying, cradling my memories,...

00:22:29.200 --> 00:22:35.700
...won't help even one
of my feelings to reach you.

00:22:37.300 --> 00:22:44.730
I will offer up an eternal prayer.

00:22:44.930 --> 00:22:51.360
I will never give up on what matters.

00:22:53.330 --> 00:23:00.260
I will find the dawn
between you and I,...

00:23:01.060 --> 00:23:08.700
...and meet the approaching daybreak.

00:23:09.200 --> 00:23:13.930
I will go there, praying.

00:23:14.600 --> 00:23:16.700
Mariel and Ritsuko were so cute!

00:23:16.900 --> 00:23:18.930
But that was so sad.

00:23:20.030 --> 00:23:21.930
Let's take a look
at the next book!

00:23:50.260 --> 00:23:53.530
Next Time: Quill
Yami, the Hat and the Book Traveler

00:23:53.530 --> 00:23:56.660
Please enjoy the next story as well.
